flowchart LR
  subgraph Client[外部客户端与Git]
    SDK[AWS SDK / S3 CLI]
    LFS[git-lfs 标准客户端]
    GIT[自研 GitGit Core]
    UI[Web UI / minios3ctl]
  end
  subgraph Edge[Rust Protocol & Identity Plane]
    S3[S3 Gateway SigV4]
    LFSAPI[LFS Gateway]
    ADMIN[Admin API]
    POLICY[Identity / IAM / KMS]
  end
  subgraph Meta[Rust Metadata Plane]
    RAFT[Raft Meta Cluster]
    BUCKET[Bucket/Version Catalog]
    CAS[CAS/OID 授权]
    ROUTE[Route Epoch & Placement]
    AUDIT[Audit Outbox]
  end
  subgraph Data[Storage Plane]
    NATIVE[Rust Native EC Storage]
    FED[Rust Federation S3 Adapter]
    S3AWS[AWS S3]
    S3ALT[Other S3 Provider]
  end
  subgraph Async[Rust Task Plane]
    MIG[Migration / Replication]
    INDEX[Git Index / Search]
    PREVIEW[Media Sandboxed Worker]
    GC[Safe Git GC / Scrub]
  end
  SDK --> S3
  LFS --> LFSAPI
  GIT <-->|Pre-receive / Ref Events| LFSAPI
  UI --> ADMIN
  S3 --> POLICY
  LFSAPI --> POLICY
  ADMIN --> POLICY
  POLICY --> RAFT
  S3 --> BUCKET
  LFSAPI --> CAS
  BUCKET --> RAFT
  CAS --> RAFT
  ROUTE --> RAFT
  RAFT --> AUDIT
  BUCKET --> ROUTE
  ROUTE --> NATIVE
  ROUTE --> FED
  FED --> S3AWS
  FED --> S3ALT
  RAFT --> MIG
  RAFT --> INDEX
  RAFT --> GC
  RAFT --> PREVIEW
  INDEX <--> GIT
